<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - National Fuel said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - National Fuel said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dean Witter downgraded National Fuel Gas Co to neutral from accumulate, a Dean Witter source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock slipped 1/4 to 42-1/2.</p>
</text>
